────────────────────
+ This

input-host = this as InputHost

────────────────────
on terminal.ready

` The window is its own batch root. Markup construction mounts it eagerly; imperatively built
` windows mount here, and adoption prunes already-mounted subtrees. Mount dirtiness schedules
` the batch queue, and the first paint checkpoints it, so the initial styles settle without an
` explicit request.
markup-mount-root(this, this)

is-terminal-ready = true
set-paint-scheduler(terminal.schedule-paint)
size = terminal.view-size
catch markup-batch-queue.checkpoint()
focus: next-focus-candidate(null)
schedule-paint()

